<title>ITALY: Italian refinery runs fall 1.7 pct in Jan - trade.</title>
<headline>Italian refinery runs fall 1.7 pct in Jan - trade.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian refinery runs fell 1.7 percent in January versus a year ago to 7.9 million tonnes, according to trade body Unione Petrolifera.</p>
<p>It said crude refinery runs fell 3.6 percent while imported semi-finished products rose 24.0 percent.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
